KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp20
static assertion failed: primary template of kind$
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^EXIT=6$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
The static_assert fails while kind<int> is instantiated for the
requires-clause; that is not in the immediate context of the constraint
([temp.constr.atomic]/3, [temp.deduct.general]/8), so g++ and clang++
reject the program.  CBMC takes the constraint as not satisfied.
